easymd-mcp
==========

Local stdio MCP server built from the easymd project:
https://github.com/Rimagination/easymd/tree/main/agents/mcp

It exposes easymd's deterministic Markdown capabilities to any MCP-capable
agent — render (WeChat / Zhihu / HTML with inlined CSS), lint, parse, extract —
without requiring the web app or network access.

This package is part of the easymd work and reuses the repository's Markdown
pipeline and tool definitions, so it is distributed under the same license:
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0-only). See LICENSE.

Corresponding Source:

  * https://github.com/Rimagination/easymd — full source, including
    agent-build/ (entry-mcp.ts and build.mjs, which produce dist/easymd-mcp.mjs)
    and src/lib/mcp/easymd-server.ts (the shared tool definitions);
  * rebuild with:

      pnpm install
      node agent-build/build.mjs mcp

